@req:1151525req@
Increases the chance to trigger the Static Shock talent by 50%.

Using Stormstrike adds 3 charges to your Lightning Shield.

@req:1182001:0:req@
Primal Strike no longer costs mana and summons an Earthen Spike below the target, dealing high-threat physical damage to nearby enemies and restores 30% of your base mana. 

In addition, the cooldown of Primal Strike is reduced by 2 sec.

@req:1155198req@
Using Tidal Force or Nature's Swiftness also increases your spell haste by 15% for 15 seconds.

Healing with Lesser Healing Wave, Healing Wave, Chain Heal or the instant part of Riptide reduces the cooldown of your Nature's Swiftness and Tidal Force by 1 seconds.

@req:1161295req@
Every third cast of Riptide grants you Primal Tide.
Primal Tide: Your next Riptide will apply to 2 additional nearby allies and last for an extra 6 seconds.

While Shamanistic Rage or Air Ascendance is active. dealing damage with Stormstrike deals an additional 148.11 Nature to your target and nearby enemies.

Using Stormstrike now reduces the cooldown of Air Ascendance and Shamanistic Rage by 0 sec.

@ext:The damage is split when hitting more than 3 enemies.:ext@

Teaches you: Tidal Force

@ext:Can not be used if the Tidal Force talent is learned.:ext@ 
